.TH AMIGA-FILE-FORGE 1 "August 2026" "Amiga File Forge" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
amiga-file-forge \- open and maintain Amiga media images
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amiga-file-forge
.RI [ image ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Amiga File Forge is a GTK desktop application for browsing, editing,
validating and converting Amiga, Amiga 600, Amiga 4000 and AmigaOS disk,
dms, ROM and hard-drive images.
.PP
Files named on the command line are opened through the same private-copy and
format-validation path as the GTK file chooser. A matching Hardfile HDA and GEO
pair is treated as one image.
.PP
HFE floppy images and SCP flux captures are decoded and encoded with the bundled
HxCFloppyEmulator command-line converter, hxcfe. Clean sector-based HFE v1
images are editable and are decoded again for byte-exact verification before
download. Advanced or damaged HFE and SCP images open read-only.
.PP
Any open OFS or FFS image can be converted to another container with the
Export control in the pane header, or File, Export as. Every such image can be
written back as its canonical sector image; OFS images of any size, and FFS S,
M and L floppies, can also be wrapped as HFE or SCP. Flux exports are decoded
again and compared byte for byte with the working sectors before the file is
released. The control is disabled for media with no compatible target, such as
a Hardfile HDA and GEO pair.
.PP
With the official Greaseweazle tools installed, the native edition can write an
open floppy image to a connected drive and capture a physical disk back into a
new working image. Captures may be taken as decoded OFS or FFS sectors, or as
HFE or SCP flux for disks of unknown condition. A capture is only opened once
Greaseweazle exits cleanly and leaves a usable image, and a failed capture
removes its partial file.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AMIGA_FILE_FORGE_DISABLE_WEBKIT_SANDBOX
Set to auto, 0 or 1. The default auto mode enables the compatibility fallback
only when Ubuntu reports its restricted unprivileged-user-namespace policy.
.TP
.B AMIGA_FS-UAE_ROOT, AMIGA_BEM_ROOT, AMIGA_MAME_EXECUTABLE, AMIGA_MAME_ROM_PATH
Override optional native emulator and firmware locations.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/amiga-file-forge/work
Private working images when XDG_DATA_HOME is unset.
.TP
.I ~/.config/amiga-file-forge
Owner identity and atomic client state when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is unset.
.SH SEE ALSO
The installed handbook is under
.IR /usr/share/doc/amiga-file-forge/ .
The HFE, SCP and HxCFE guide is
.IR /usr/share/doc/amiga-file-forge/handbook/HFE-HXC-GUIDE.md .
